  "Agreeableness":     {"score": 3, "behavioral_evidence": "Initially very low, displaying anger and intimidation (\"You would dare to defy the gods?\"), he later shifts to acknowledging the dwarf's integrity and showing trust (\"I appreciate your unwavering commitment to upholding those rules.\")."},
  "Neuroticism":       {"score": 4, "behavioral_evidence": "He frequently displays strong negative emotions, explicitly stating he is \"losing my temper\" and \"furious,\" and emits multiple growls and glares throughout the interaction."}
